      "retrievedAt": "2026-10-18",
      "seedBasis": "seed 7 is one of the three seeds frozen for B-milestone acceptance. At 512m it grades 60 of the 84 candidate street segments on a 5m datum (max roadbed fill 4.59m, 2 relief refusals). Seed 42 keeps 33 segments on a 7m datum and needs 6.65-7.88m of final roadbed fill, which is over the 6m earthwork contract and reads as an embankment town rather than a river quay.",
      "inferenceReason": "river-delta is the registered morphology for a delta city whose core sits on both banks of a main channel (Amsterdam, Wuhan): three cores strung along the river axis, a main street plus side streets, a 0.78 density gradient, and farmland along the channel. This crop keeps one channel, both banks and the crossings inside 512m."
